    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good point about the itinerary. i'm just worried about the unpredictability of it all. one minute everything is fine, and the next, some officer decides there's a problem and everything goes sideways. is there any way to prepare for that \"unpredictable\" element of border crossings? like, how do we handle the weirdness of these bureaucratic gates where things feel really arbitrary and out of our control?",
